# Environments (local / dev / prod)

## Entrypoint-based environment selection (REQUIRED)
This app selects its environment via **separate entrypoints**:

- `lib/main_local.dart` (default)
- `lib/main_dev.dart`
- `lib/main_prod.dart`

Each entrypoint must set `AppConfig` **before** `runApp()` starts. Environment values live in:

- `lib/config/local.dart`
- `lib/config/dev.dart`
- `lib/config/prod.dart`

## Hard rules
- ✅ All environment-specific values must live only in `lib/config/{local,dev,prod}.dart`
- ✅ Each entrypoint must:
  - load the correct config
  - set `AppConfig` once
  - then call `runApp(App(...))`
- ✅ App code must read config **only** via `AppConfig` (or a single injected config provider)
- ✅ `main.dart` is not used for environment switching unless explicitly required later
- ✅ Environment must be decided at process start (entrypoint), not at runtime via toggles

## Run (choose one)
```bash
# local (default)
flutter run -t lib/main_local.dart

# dev
flutter run -t lib/main_dev.dart

# prod
flutter run -t lib/main_prod.dart
